WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
- You have two boys.

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.850
Do they help in the kitchen now?

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.930
- Yes, four and two.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.120
Hugo and Gus and-
- Taste test.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.970
- They tell me what to cook.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.061
They try to help and
I'm their private chef.

00:00:12.061 --> 00:00:14.280
And no matter what I make,
they almost never eat.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.750
So it's a problem for me.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.640
- That actually makes me feel good.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.567
'cause when I do cook, I'm like,

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:22.491
"Do you know how hard this was for me?"

00:00:22.491 --> 00:00:24.750
I don't do this and I
feel like I did a good job

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.370
and they do not eat it.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.050
And I'm like, it makes me feel good

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.700
that you're an actual chef.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.837
And yeah, they just are like,

00:00:31.837 --> 00:00:33.171
"Hard pass, where's the mac and cheese."

00:00:33.171 --> 00:00:34.290
- Yeah, they want mac and cheese.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.510
They want all shades of brown foods.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.280
- Beige! My son eats nothing

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.840
but beige.
- Beige anything.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.370
- Mine even, it's gotten to the point

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.830
where I definitely take orders,

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.950
but I have to actually just,
at this point with Miles,

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.380
I said the other day, "He
doesn't eat vegetables."

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.540
And I mean, not a carrot stick.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.760
It's just like a big-
- My son will not.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.771
He's like, "Absolutely not."
- Thank you.

00:00:54.771 --> 00:00:55.604
- "Hard Pass."

00:00:55.604 --> 00:00:56.437
- No one wants to admit to that.

00:00:56.437 --> 00:00:58.470
But then, I was like, oh
no, it goes past that.

00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.880
I can offer him a root beer float.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.230
He doesn't wanna try
that. He doesn't wanna...

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.260
I'm like, "Please try this Coca-Cola."

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.360
And then I'm like, "Why am I trying?"

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.193
It's just be being crazy.

00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:08.640
- But my son is the same though.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.090
I have to sneak it in,
into a cup that's colorful,

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.890
that you can't tell what the color is.

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:16.950
And that's how I sneak it in,
is like a juice or a smoothie.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.440
He will not do it, and he'll smell it out,

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.720
and be like, "This is a vegetable."

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.610
And he is hard against it, yeah.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.530
- Same.
- I mean, it's like,

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.510
I could make him sit there or whatever,

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:28.920
but it just doesn't work.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.300
He'll sit me out.
- I know.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.550
- He will be like, "I'll be
at this table all night long."

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.427
- Before kids, you're like,

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:34.860
"If they don't eat what I make,

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.060
then they're going to bed hungry."

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.449
I'm like, "Oh, what would you like, sir?"

00:01:38.449 --> 00:01:39.600
(audience laughs)

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:40.948
- No, I will say if my son were here...

00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:43.042
I have sent him to bed hungry.

00:01:43.042 --> 00:01:44.040
(all laugh)

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.360
Because usually I'm tired.
- Yes.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.040
- I'm like, "I just did this.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.000
If you didn't like it, that's yo problem."

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.190
(Chrissy laughs)

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.193
- I said, "I made exactly what
you said," and then whatever.

